OL,3,GNEWSACannabis farm fly-tips a 'plague'
OL,4,Aon countryside
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dumping of waste from illegal
OL,7,Fcannabis farms in the countryside has
OL,8,Fbeen described as a plague and a
OL,9,Fgrowing problem by a councillor.
OL,11,FNorth Hertfordshire District Council
OL,12,F(NHDC) said there had been 90 cases of
OL,13,Fcannabis farm fly-tipping on its rural
OL,14,Froads bordering Luton since August
OL,15,F2024.
OL,17,FIt said the locations of the fly-tips
OL,18,Fsuggested the waste originated from the
OL,19,Ftown.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
